(   current rise: $\\frac{di}{dt} > 5\\text{ kA/}\\mu\\text{s}$. Any parasitic inductance in the power) Tj
T*
(   loop \($L_{loop}$\) induces massive voltage overshoots: $V_{overshoot} = L_{loop} \\frac{di}{dt}$.) Tj
T*
(   Layout designers must place high-frequency ceramic decoupling capacitors immediately adjacent) Tj
T*
(   to switch terminals, routing forward and return traces on overlapping adjacent layers to) Tj
T*
(   achieve magnetic field cancellation and keep $L_{loop} < 5\\text{ nH}$.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Creepage and Clearance Coordination \(IEC 60664-1\):) Tj
T*
(   High-voltage rails \(400V/800V DC\) require strict physical separation along board surfaces) Tj
T*
(   \(creepage\) and through air \(clearance\) based on pollution degree and Comparative Tracking Index) Tj
T*
(   \(CTI\). Designers mill isolation slots into the PCB beneath optocouplers and transformers.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Thermal Dissipation Management:) Tj
T*
(   Surface-mount power devices dissipate heat into the PCB. Dense arrays of thermal vias \(0.3 mm) Tj
T*
(   drill diameter, spaced 1 mm apart\) conduct heat from top copper pads to internal 2 oz ground) Tj
T*
(   planes and aluminum baseplates.) Tj
