T*
(   Student Engineering Competitions & Experiential Learning:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Solar Decathlon \(U.S. DOE & Solar Decathlon India\):) Tj
T*
(   Challenges collegiate teams to design and build full-scale, zero-net-energy buildings powered) Tj
T*
