T*
(   A national non-stop 36-hour innovation competition organized by the Government of India.) Tj
T*
(   Ministries and public utilities \(such as the Ministry of Power, NHPC, and state DISCOMs\) submit) Tj
T*
(   real-world industrial problem statements: smart metering theft detection, automated fault) Tj
T*
(   locators, AI-driven renewable forecasting, and IoT sensor hubs. Participating students develop) Tj
T*
(   rapid working prototypes, cultivating teamwork, agile problem-solving, rapid prototyping, and) Tj
T*
(   high-impact communication skills.) Tj
