T*
(   Insulation Coordination \(IEC 60071\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Insulation coordination selects equipment insulation strength based on expected network) Tj
T*
(   overvoltages:) Tj
T*
(   1. Standard Lightning Impulse Test: Standard $1.2 / 50\\,\\mu\\text{s}$ wave shape \(rises to peak) Tj
T*
(   in $1.2\\,\\mu\\text{s}$, decays to half in $50\\,\\mu\\text{s}$\) simulating atmospheric lightning) Tj
T*
(   strikes.) Tj
T*
(   2. Switching Impulse Test: Standard $250 / 2500\\,\\mu\\text{s}$ wave shape simulating circuit) Tj
T*
(   breaker operations in EHV networks.) Tj
T*
(   3. Power-Frequency Withstand Test: 50 Hz AC voltage applied for 60 seconds to verify basic) Tj
T*
(   dielectric integrity.) Tj
