T*
(   - Category 1 \($4\\text{ cal/cm}^2$\): Arc-rated shirt and pants, face shield.) Tj
T*
(   - Category 2 \($8\\text{ cal/cm}^2$\): Arc-rated face shield with balaclava, heavy jacket.) Tj
T*
(   - Category 4 \($40\\text{ cal/cm}^2$\): Multi-layer arc flash flash suit \('bomb suit'\), hood with) Tj
T*
