T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Motor Control Centers \(MCC\):) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Enclosure Structure: Floor-mounted metal modular enclosures housing multiple standardized) Tj
T*
(   drawout motor starter buckets.) Tj
T*
(   2. Bucket Components: Molded Case Circuit Breaker \(MCCB\), contactor, electronic overload relay,) Tj
T*
(   control power transformer, and pushbuttons/indicator lamps.) Tj
T*
(   3. Drawout Functionality: Permits individual motor starters to be racked out for maintenance) Tj
T*
(   while the main busbars remain energized, maximizing industrial plant uptime.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
