T*
(   Battery Cell Emulators in BMS Testing:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   1. Hardware Stage: Multiple independent, isolated multi-channel power supplies capable of) Tj
T*
(   sourcing and sinking current with millivolt accuracy.) Tj
T*
(   2. Emulation Capability: Emulates individual cell voltages \(0 to 5V\), individual cell) Tj
T*
(   temperatures, and faults \(open-circuit cell, shorted cell, over-temperature\) in real-time,) Tj
T*
(   verifying that the physical BMS executes cell balancing and safety disconnects accurately.) Tj
T*
