(   [Problem Statement]: Describe the IEEE Std 1547.1 compliance testing procedures for grid-interactive distributed energy resource inverters.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   IEEE 1547.1 Conformance Testing:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Inverters undergo testing using programmable AC grid simulators and DC solar emulators:) Tj
T*
(   - Over/Under Voltage and Frequency Trip Testing.) Tj
T*
(   - Anti-Islanding Test using resonant RLC load banks adjusted to match inverter active and) Tj
T*
(   reactive power output.) Tj
T*
(   - Harmonics and Interharmonics Verification at 10%, 20%, 50%, and 100% rated power.) Tj
