(   [Problem Statement]: Detail the principles of design-for-testability \(DFT\) in embedded electrical hardware.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Design for Testability \(DFT\) in Hardware Engineering:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Incorporating dedicated test structures into PCB layouts:) Tj
T*
(   - Test Points: SMT pads for oscilloscope probes and automated bed-of-nails test fixtures.) Tj
T*
(   - Boundary Scan \(JTAG IEEE 1149.1\): Hardware shift registers inside digital ICs that verify) Tj
T*
(   pin-to-pin soldering continuity without mechanical probe access.) Tj
T*
(   - Built-In Self-Test \(BIST\): Microcontroller firmware routines that test RAM, flash CRC, and) Tj
T*
(   peripheral clocks upon bootup.) Tj
