T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   Multidisciplinary Systems Engineering Integration:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   Major infrastructure projects \(metro rail systems, offshore wind farms, hyperscale data) Tj
T*
(   centers\) require close coordination among multiple engineering branches:) Tj
T*
(   - Civil & Structural Engineers: Substation foundation civil works, tower wind loading, and) Tj
T*
(   seismic design.) Tj
T*
(   - Mechanical Engineers: Turbine thermal thermodynamics, transformer oil heat exchangers, and) Tj
T*
(   cooling ducts.) Tj
T*
(   - Environmental & Legal Specialists: Environmental impact assessments, right-of-way land) Tj
T*
(   acquisition, and grid code regulatory compliance.) Tj
T*
(   Successful electrical engineers cultivate cross-disciplinary fluency, agile communication, and) Tj
T*
(   comprehensive systems-level thinking.) Tj
